-----------------+---------------+-------+------------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+---------+--------------
 repeatable read | fact insert   | 0A000 | scope copies need READ COMMITTED writers | The scope copy "public.facts_by_tenant" is kept by statement triggers that read the snapshot of the transaction, which is repeatable read. | run the change in a READ COMMITTED transaction, or drop the copy with sift.scope_drop | f       |            0
